@startuml sd_us112
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US112 - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "ATCC" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of airports-routes" as EAR
box "airports-routes-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "RouteController" as RouteController
participant "UpdateRouteUseCase" as UpdateRouteUseCase
participant "DeactivateRouteUseCase" as DeactivateRouteUseCase
database "own database" as DBAR
participant "Outbox dispatcher" as OBAR
end box
collections "peer replicas\nairports-routes-m" as PAR
== PUT /api/routes/{origin}/{destination} ==
Actor -> EAR : PUT /api/routes/{origin}/{destination}\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAR -> RouteController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
RouteController -> UpdateRouteUseCase : execute(...)
UpdateRouteUseCase -> DBAR : find route
alt held by this replica
UpdateRouteUseCase -> DBAR : check version, apply the change\n+ copy for the other holder in the outbox (same transaction)
UpdateRouteUseCase --> RouteController : updated
RouteController --> Actor : 200 OK
OBAR -> PAR : PUT /internal/replicas/routes\n(to the other holder, retried until delivered)
else not held here
RouteController -> PAR : same PUT, X-Peer-Forwarded\n(to the peers one at a time, until a holder answers)
PAR --> RouteController : 200 from the holder
RouteController --> Actor : 200 OK (X-Data-Node)
note over PAR : the holder copies the change\nto the other holder
end
== PATCH /api/routes/{origin}/{destination}/deactivate ==
Actor -> EAR : PATCH /api/routes/{origin}/{destination}/deactivate\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAR -> RouteController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
RouteController -> DeactivateRouteUseCase : execute(...)
DeactivateRouteUseCase -> DBAR : find route
alt held by this replica
DeactivateRouteUseCase -> DBAR : check version, apply the change\n+ copy for the other holder in the outbox (same transaction)
DeactivateRouteUseCase --> RouteController : updated
RouteController --> Actor : 200 OK
OBAR -> PAR : PUT /internal/replicas/routes\n(to the other holder, retried until delivered)
else not held here
RouteController -> PAR : same PATCH, X-Peer-Forwarded\n(to the peers one at a time, until a holder answers)
PAR --> RouteController : 200 from the holder
RouteController --> Actor : 200 OK (X-Data-Node)
note over PAR : the holder copies the change\nto the other holder
end
@enduml
